  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut corn cob in half.\n• Transfer corn to a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave corn on high, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Drain any excess liquid. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67ce9c1dfc617b70a129fdc1-9f97f40c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. Season with salt and pepper. TIP: If your pan is getting crowded, cook in batches for the best results!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67ce9c1dfc617b70a129fdc1-2d2f51d9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve continental rolls and toast or grill to your liking.\n• In a medium bowl combine rocket and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil.\n• Spread continental rolls with plant-based aioli. Top with rocket, plant-based chicken and cheddar cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67ce9c1dfc617b70a129fdc1-ad7254f3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide plant-based crumbed chicken burgers between plates. Serve with corn cob. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67ce9c1dfc617b70a129fdc1-8baf4c9b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
